# J413（MacBook Air M2）Wi-Fi/蓝牙固件映射：Apple 固件包内的源文件名 → 内核请求名。
#
# 【为什么需要这张表】Apple 固件包里的文件名不带板型后缀，brcmfmac 却按「板型后缀链」
# 逐个请求（serial.log:289-294 实测：-TPHN-u-4.7-X2 → -TPHN-u-4.7 → -TPHN-u →
# -TPHN → -X2 → 无后缀），每条都 failed with error -2 后才放弃且不重试。
# 只把源文件名放进 initramfs 永远不会命中，补文件也不会亮 Wi-Fi。
#
# 【格式】每行「源文件名」后跟一个或多个「内核请求名」，空白分隔；# 起注释。
# 第一个请求名落真实副本，其余在同目录内做成指向它的符号链接（与 asahi-fwextract 同做法），
# 这样 initramfs 不会为每个别名多存一份几 MB 的固件。
#
# 【消费方】以下三处必须共读这一份，不得各写一遍：
#   dev/m2/build.py                       装配 initramfs 与安装镜像
#   config/platform/m2/boot-sync.sh       换内核时重建 initramfs
#   config/platform/m2/verify-hardware.sh 装机验收
# install-external.sh 按同一张表补齐 /lib/firmware/vendorfw 里的请求名。

brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.bin  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7-X2.bin  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7.bin  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u.bin  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN.bin  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-X2.bin  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.bin
brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.txt  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7-X2.txt  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7.txt  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u.txt  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN.txt  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-X2.txt  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.txt
brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.clm_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7-X2.clm_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7.clm_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u.clm_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN.clm_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-X2.clm_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.clm_blob
brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.txcap_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7-X2.txcap_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u-4.7.txcap_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN-u.txcap_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-TPHN.txcap_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido-X2.txcap_blob  brcm/brcmfmac4387c2-pcie.apple,hokkaido.txcap_blob

